<title>USA: AMEX to list Blyth, other options Feb 20.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list Blyth, other options Feb 20.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Wednesday it would list options on Blyth Industries Inc, Southern Peru Copper Corp, Jack Henry &amp; Associates Inc, Infoseek Corp and Lernout &amp; Hauspie Speech Products NV on Thursday, February 20.</p>
<p>The following table lists the stocks' ticker symbols, the options' initial strike prices, initial expiration months, position limits and specialist unit.</p>
<p>Ticker	Strikes	 Months	Limits    Specialist</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>     30, 35, 40    Mar, Apr,   4,500     TFM Investment</p>
<p>				  Jun, Sep		    Group</p>
<p>     15, 17-1/2,   Mar, Apr,   4,500     Spear, Leeds &amp;</p>
<p>		20		Jun, Sep		    Kellogg</p>
<p>    30, 35, 40    Mar, Apr,   4,500     Cohen, Duffy &amp;</p>
<p>				  Jun, Sep		    McGowan</p>
<p>    7-1/2, 10,    Mar, Apr,   4,500     LETCO-</p>
<p>		12-1/2	  Jun, Sep		    Specialist LP</p>
<p>    20, 22-1/2,   Mar, Apr,   4,500     Susquehanna</p>
<p>		25		Jun, Sep		    Investment Gp</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750)) ((E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
